#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:7
msgid "Decides if the buttons for the special Spanish characters are visible."
msgstr "Leggt fast, wat de Knööp för de besünneren spaanschen Bookstaven sichtbor sünd."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:12
msgid "Decides if the KVTML-files are loaded automatically."
msgstr "Leggt fast, wat de KVTML-Dateien automatsch laadt warrt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:17
msgid "Decides whether a verb selection will be used or the entire verb stock."
msgstr "Leggt fast, wat en Köör oder all Verben bruukt warrt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:22
msgid "Trained verbs that aren't in the users verb selection are added to the selection automatically."
msgstr "Öövt Verben, de dat nich binnen den Bruker sien Verbenköör gifft, warrt ehr automaatsch toföögt."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:23
msgid "The user can select verbs he knows and that he wants to practice in a verbselection. This is a subset of all verbs. In some trainers he can be faced to verbs that aren't in the selection yet. For example the VerbViewTrainer in he enters a verb that isn't in the selection yet. If autoSelect is true such verbs are added automatically to the list."
msgstr "De Bruker kann binnen en Verben-Utwahl begäng Verben utsöken, de he öven will. Dit is en Ünnersett vun all Verben. En poor Öven stellt ok Verben praat, de noch nich binnen de Utwahl sünd, a.B. de \"VerbViewTrainer\". Is \"autoSelect\" anmaakt, warrt disse Verben automaatsch toföögt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:28
msgid "Decides whether the accents are ignored while correcting input or not."
msgstr "Fastleggen, wat Akzenten wielt de Korrektuuringaav övergahn warrt oder nich."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:33
msgid "If true always the Spanish infinitive will be used."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt jümmers de spaansche Grundform bruukt."

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:34 kverbos.kcfg:40 kverbos.kcfg:46
msgid "If a KVTML file is loaded there might be a translation for a verb. Now the programm can present the verb in Spanish, the translation or do it accidentally."
msgstr "Wenn en KVTML-Datei laadt wöör, bargt dat villicht en Översetten för en Verb. Dat Programm kann denn Verben op Spaansch, översett, oder tofällig mischt wiesen."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:39
msgid "If true always the Foreign infinitive will be used."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt jümmers de butenlannsche Grundform bruukt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:45
msgid "If true the Spanish and foreign infinitives will be used accidentally."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt spaansch un butenlannsch Grundformen mischt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:51
msgid "SingleUser"
msgstr "Een Bruker"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:52
msgid "If SingleUser is false the program starts with an user login widget, where the user can select his learning group and his user name. If the value is true the user login widgit isn't shown and the default user settings are used all the time."
msgstr "Wenn \"Een Bruker\" utmaakt is, start dat Programm mit en Anmellenfinster för de Ingaav vun Lehrkoppel un Brukernaam. Is \"Een Bruker\" anmaakt, denn warrt keen Anmellenfinster wiest, un jümmers mit de Instellen för den Standardbruker start."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:57
msgid "The name of the last user using the program."
msgstr "Den verleden Bruker sien Naam"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (translationLanguage), group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:62
msgid "Set the default translation"
msgstr "De Standard-Översetten fastleggen"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (minimalNumberOfVerbs), group (kverbos)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:67
msgid "In the formstrainer there should be at least minimalNumberOfVerbs verbs for a learning session. This is not a must. But if there are less than minimalNumberOfVerbs verbs some verbs that are blocked at the moment are used to fill the list of verbs to learn."
msgstr "De Formentrainer schull tominnst de lüttst Tall vun Verben för en Less bargen. Dat is twaars nich hoochnödig, man mit weniger Verben warrt de Öven-List villicht mit en poor opstunns noch torüchhollen Verben vullmaakt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (clock)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:75 kverbos.kcfg:79
msgid "Decides if the clock is used as a clock or a timer that counts backwards."
msgstr "Leggt fast, wat de Klock as Klock bruukt warrt, oder as torüchtellen Stoppklock."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (clock)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:83
msgid "The time in minutes the timer should count."
msgstr "De Tietvörgaav för de Stoppklock in Minuten"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (kvtml)
#. +> trunk
#: kverbos.kcfg:91
msgid "If true then the contents of the kvtml files in the list are loaded."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt de oplist KVTML-Dateien ehr Inholt laadt."

